    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay good, i was worried for a sec. but the swelling is kind of making my rings stuck and my skin feels really tight. and the lights are a bit distracting when i'm trying to drive. you're sure i don't need to go get checked out or anything? i'd rather avoid the hospital if i can help it, it's so expensive and exhausting.",
